<script setup lang="ts">
import {computed,ref} from 'vue'
import {number,time} from '../format'
import {reviewState,reviewGroup,timingMetric,type Review} from '../quantReview'
import QuantExitAttribution from './QuantExitAttribution.vue'
const props=defineProps<{value:Review}>()
const window=ref<'daily'|'week'>('daily'),dimension=ref('Direction')
const period=computed(()=>props.value[window.value]),metrics=computed(()=>period.value.metrics)
const groups=computed(()=>period.value.groups.filter(g=>g.dimension===dimension.value))
const exits=computed(()=>period.value.trades.filter(t=>t.attribution?.legs.length))
</script>
<template><section class="quant-review"><div class="review-heading"><div><h3>完整交易评审</h3><p>{{reviewState(value.readiness.status)}} · {{value.readiness.confirmedClosed}}笔已核对完整交易 / 最少{{value.readiness.minimumClosed}}笔，经过{{number(value.readiness.elapsedDays,2)}}天 / 最少{{value.readiness.minimumDays}}天。</p></div><div class="review-switch" role="group" aria-label="交易评审周期"><button :aria-pressed="window==='daily'" @click="window='daily'">本日退出</button><button :aria-pressed="window==='week'" @click="window='week'">本周退出</button></div></div>
<p>所选{{window==='daily'?'日':'周'}} {{time(period.from)}} 至 {{time(period.through)}}，按最终退出日归属整笔结果，费用核验截至 {{time(value.asOf)}}。此处净额与上方按入账日统计的结算净额不能相加。</p>
<p v-if="value.readiness.status!=='ReviewRequired'" class="review-notice">当前证据不足以调整或确认策略盈利。样本量、运行质量和完整交易分别核对，不为凑数强行交易。</p><p v-else class="review-notice">达到最低样本量只代表可以开始正式评审；还需检验成本压力、集中度和不确定性，未自动确认策略盈利。</p>
<div class="review-stats"><div><small>确认完整 / 仍持仓</small><strong>{{metrics.confirmed}} / {{period.openPositions}}</strong><small>待补费{{period.awaitFunding}} · 资料不全{{period.incomplete}} · 不一致{{period.inconsistent}}</small></div><div><small>整笔净额 / 平均每笔 U</small><strong>{{number(metrics.netPnl,4)}}</strong><small>{{metrics.averageNet==null?'暂无完整样本':number(metrics.averageNet,4)}}</small></div><div><small>平均净R / 胜率</small><strong>{{metrics.averageR==null?'暂无样本':number(metrics.averageR,3)+' R'}}</strong><small>{{metrics.winRate==null?'暂无完整样本':number(metrics.winRate,1)+'% · 仅描述统计'}}</small></div><div><small>亏损超支次数 / 总额 U</small><strong>{{metrics.riskOverruns}} / {{number(metrics.lossBeyondPlan,4)}}</strong><small>超过入场含成本计划风险的部分</small></div></div>
<p>完整样本毛额 {{number(metrics.grossPnl,6)}} − 手续费 {{number(metrics.fees,6)}} − 资金费及迟到调整 {{number(metrics.funding,6)}} = 净额 {{number(metrics.netPnl,6)}} U。净成本 {{number(metrics.netCost,6)}} U（正付负收），占各笔绝对毛额之和{{metrics.costToAbsoluteGrossPercent==null?'未知':number(metrics.costToAbsoluteGrossPercent,2)+'%'}}；利润因子{{metrics.profitFactor==null?'未定义（无亏损或无完整样本）':number(metrics.profitFactor,3)}}。</p>
<details v-if="exits.length" class="exit-attributions"><summary>退出亏损与风险差异 · {{exits.length}}笔有退出样本</summary><p>按保存资料分解原风险预算与实际结果，正增亏、负改善；目标盈利退出也保留。{{period.tradesLimited?'仅列当前列表最近100笔，不代表全账本归因合计。':''}}</p><details v-for="t in exits" :key="t.positionId"><summary>{{t.symbol}} · {{reviewGroup(t.direction)}} · {{reviewState(t.status)}}</summary><QuantExitAttribution :value="t.attribution!"/></details></details>
<details v-if="period.groups.length"><summary>按方向、策略、入场环境比较</summary><div class="review-switch" role="group" aria-label="交易分组"><button v-for="group in [{key:'Direction',name:'方向'},{key:'Strategy',name:'策略'},{key:'Environment',name:'环境'}]" :key="group.key" :aria-pressed="dimension===group.key" @click="dimension=group.key">{{group.name}}</button></div><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>分组</th><th>完整笔数</th><th>净额 / 平均 U</th><th>平均R / 胜率</th><th>净成本 U</th><th>超支次数 / 额 U</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="g in groups" :key="g.value"><td>{{reviewGroup(g.value)}}</td><td>{{g.metrics.confirmed}}</td><td>{{number(g.metrics.netPnl,4)}} / {{number(g.metrics.averageNet,4)}}</td><td>{{number(g.metrics.averageR,3)}} / {{number(g.metrics.winRate,1)}}%</td><td>{{number(g.metrics.netCost,4)}}</td><td>{{g.metrics.riskOverruns}} / {{number(g.metrics.lossBeyondPlan,4)}}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>同一笔交易会在三种维度各出现一次，不能把不同维度的合计相加。小样本分组不用于自动挑选策略。</p></details>
<details class="review-trades"><summary>逐笔计划风险与实际结果 · {{period.trades.length}}条</summary><p v-if="period.tradesLimited">仅列最近100笔；上方指标使用完整账本。</p><p v-if="!period.trades.length">当前范围尚无对应完整或待核对的交易。</p><div v-else class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>合约 / 最终退出</th><th>状态</th><th>原计划风险 U</th><th>实际净额 U / 净R</th><th>净成本 U / 占绝对毛额</th><th>亏损超支 U / 比例</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="t in period.trades" :key="t.positionId"><td>{{t.symbol}}<small>{{reviewGroup(t.direction)}} · {{reviewGroup(t.strategy)}}</small><small>{{t.closedAt?time(t.closedAt):'尚未最终退出'}}</small></td><td>{{reviewState(t.status)}}<small>{{t.reason}}</small></td><td>{{number(t.plannedRisk,6)}}</td><td>{{t.netPnl==null?'待确认':number(t.netPnl,6)}}<small>{{t.netR==null?'—':number(t.netR,4)+' R'}}</small></td><td>{{t.netCost==null?'待确认':number(t.netCost,6)}}<small>{{t.costToAbsoluteGrossPercent==null?'—':number(t.costToAbsoluteGrossPercent,2)+'%'}}</small></td><td>{{t.lossBeyondPlan==null?'待确认':number(t.lossBeyondPlan,6)}}<small>{{t.lossBeyondPlanPercent==null?'—':number(t.lossBeyondPlanPercent,2)+'%'}}</small></td></tr></tbody></table></div></details>
<details class="review-quality"><summary>运行覆盖与退出质量 · 本日退出{{value.quality.exitLegs}}腿</summary><p>账户调度{{value.quality.accountStale?'超过30秒未更新，需检查':'时间检查通过'}}；本日已结束{{value.quality.finishedHours}}个小时，其中缺冻结范围{{value.quality.missingHours}}、冻结覆盖不足{{value.quality.incompleteHours}}。冻结时基线未就绪{{value.quality.frozenBaselineIssues}}个合约时段，历史缺口不随当前补数追改。</p><p>完整本机时序{{value.quality.recordedTiming}}腿；旧部分时序{{value.quality.historicalTiming}}腿；时序异常{{value.quality.invalidTiming}}腿。以下按本日退出腿统计，与整笔交易样本数不同。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>阶段</th><th>已知样本</th><th>P50 / P95 / 最大 ms</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="t in value.quality.timings" :key="t.metric"><td>{{timingMetric(t.metric)}}</td><td>{{t.samples}}</td><td>{{t.samples?`${number(t.medianMs,1)} / ${number(t.p95Ms,1)} / ${number(t.maximumMs,1)}`:'未知，尚无本阶段样本'}}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>小样本只展示数值，不判断快慢或将价差全部归因于延迟。来源时钟不与本机相减推算网络耗时；未计磁盘确认或真实撮合。</p></details>
<details><summary>评审节奏与统计边界</summary><p>每日核对调度、冻结覆盖、账目、成本和超支；每周一选择上周日的日报日期，再切换“本周退出”检查上周结果；周一至下周一按上海时间划分。此处由后台持续保存，不自动修改策略或向外发送消息。</p><p>{{value.readiness.reason}}</p><p>最早观察时长达到门槛 {{time(value.readiness.firstReviewAfter)}}，样本不足仍延长。分组置信区间、集中度、全账户回撤及压力成本检验仍需足够前瞻资料。</p><p v-for="n in value.notices" :key="n">{{n}}</p></details><small>{{value.version}} · 不重结算原始账本</small></section></template>
<style scoped>.quant-review{border:1px solid #305048;border-radius:8px;background:#10201e;padding:18px;margin:20px 0}.review-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:start;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap}.review-heading h3{margin:0 0 10px;color:#91dec6}.review-switch{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}.review-switch button{background:#142b28;color:#9fb9b0;border:1px solid #34564d;border-radius:4px;padding:7px 10px;cursor:pointer}.review-switch button[aria-pressed=true]{background:#285548;color:#b8ffe1}.review-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px;margin:18px 0}.review-stats>div{padding:12px;background:#0e191a;border:1px solid #29413c;border-radius:6px}.review-stats strong{display:block;margin:9px 0;font-size:21px;color:#a8e2cc;font-weight:500}.quant-review small{display:block;color:#8ea69f;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.quant-review p{line-height:1.9;font-size:12px}.review-notice{border-left:2px solid #b39b63;padding-left:12px;color:#ccbc99}.quant-review details{border-top:1px solid #29433c;padding:13px 0}.quant-review summary{cursor:pointer}.quant-review td{white-space:normal;min-width:90px}.quant-review .review-switch{margin:10px 0}@media(max-width:850px){.review-stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.quant-review{padding:12px}.review-stats strong{font-size:18px}}@media(max-width:430px){.review-stats{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
